OL,3,GNEWSASeven artists picked for Paul
OL,4,AO'Grady exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew portraits of Lily Savage and Buster
OL,7,Fthe dog as well as new canine ceramic
OL,8,Ffigurines are among artworks set to go
OL,9,Fon show in an exhibition celebrating
OL,10,FPaul O'Grady's life.
OL,12,FThe new works are commissions from
OL,13,Fseven artists, chosen after an open
OL,14,Fcall for You Gotta Get a Gimmick: Paul
OL,15,FO'Grady Story at the Williamson Art
OL,16,FGallery & Museum in Birkenhead.
OL,18,FThe late TV star's husband, Andre
OL,19,FPortasio, is the creative director of
OL,20,Fthe exhibition, which will open on 11
OL,21,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
