OL,3,GNEWSASeven artists picked for Paul
OL,4,AO'Grady exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndre said Paul would have "loved" the
OL,7,Ffact the new works will become part of
OL,8,Fthe gallery's permanent collection and
OL,9,Fthat his story had inspired "new
OL,10,Fvoices, new ideas and new work that
OL,11,Fwill live on beyond the exhibition".
